        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Better go to the party surprise as usually there is no one at the counter. Asked twice to call someone, no one came after 15 minutes",
        "time": 1758064626,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karina Faramazyan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113502570064879969421/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYe8dRpEoiYEcNl0PfcJKEDZx0xJHPsKXFAVwnkEhN7ap73qg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "My sister got me 4 balloons from Party City on March 2nd. It is March 27th and one of the little monster shaped balloons keeps staring at me from the ceiling with no intention of descending. At this point it is just a science experiment. They haven’t even shrunk. The point is, if you need balloons for an occasion, I think this is the place.\n\nEdit:\nIt is currently May 16 and I am still haunted by these balloons. Maybe they are not as inflated as they were before but they are still closer to god then I ever will be. I do not have the heart to pop them because they still bring me joy. If by June they have not shrivelled up, I will release them into the wild just as nature intended.\n\nEdit: it is October 18th. He was mostly in the ground but there was a bit of helium in him not to be flat on the ground. I decided to kill him. So there, judge by yourself how good their balloons are.",
        "time": 1697682250,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shadan Eskandari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111430316863211797972/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULSv0QFDbAAydoWRxsE-Oof8xZXDPvxxyDQCCWHw5DODUgcawp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Sooooo slow and unfamiliar with the process of getting balloons filled with helium gas and etc, we were more than 30 minutes for 5 balloons!  Definitely unhappy with the service",
